From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luca Martinetti <luca@luca.io>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 08:51:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Show inferred goal, thinking, and trail in the recap
 widget

The prompt-derived Goal line only restated the last request. Add a bounded,
redacted run digest (request, tool trail, touched files, checks, thinking) and
infer the current objective from it: one call at run start, then at most one
per 30 seconds, aborted at settle. Surface the latest thinking excerpt and the
recent action sequence for free, keeping the previous step's recap visible.
